asbuilt brand, vendored.

Source: the asbuilt project (https://github.com/padamson/asbuilt), which
owns the mark, the wordmark and their spec. This copy was produced on
2026-09-28 from the generator that designed the mark, ahead of asbuilt
publishing it; once asbuilt ships a brand package, replace this directory
with that package's contents and record its version here.

Contents:
  mark.path      the mark as SVG path data for a 24x24 viewBox, currentColor
  wordmark.css   the AS/BUILT lockup: faces, colors, and the bar under BUILT
  fonts/         Bungee and Bungee Shade, latin subset, woff2, with the OFL

Nothing in here is edited by hand in this repo. A change to the brand
lands in asbuilt first and arrives here by replacing the directory.
